# Is petting pleasant? A visitor strokes the robot's head two or three times in a row, a few times over
# five minutes. Two or three touches are petting, not a reason to be angry: no Angry / Annoyed face,
# no grumble (owner, 2026-10-04: two or three touches made it angry).
duration 6:00
clock 14:00
seed 31
room_light on
owner home
at 0:05 person v enter 0 1.0
# (0:40 / 0:44 until 2026-10-28: the first touch fell in the very tick the clock synced - the night rules of the
# first 40 s ending - and with the light sensor calibrated to the robot's it was not answered; 12 s later it is)
at 0:52 touch_head 500
at 0:56 touch_head 500
at 1:40 touch_head 500
at 1:43 touch_head 500
at 1:47 touch_head 500
at 3:00 touch_head 800
at 3:04 touch_head 800
at 3:08 touch_head 800
at 4:30 touch_head 500
at 4:33 touch_head 500
at 4:36 touch_head 500
